{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40574","headline":"旅行闻寇 · 裴说","name":"旅行闻寇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"动步忧多事，将行问四邻。\n深山不畏虎，当路却防人。\n豪富田园废，疲羸屋舍新。\n自慙爲旅客，无计避烟尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}